{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"move"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"beatTime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"BeatTime","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/BeatTime"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"entryID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity of the entry to move.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The new beat time for the entry.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"beatTime"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity that now addresses this entry’s content — ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"itself, unless the move merged it into a pre-existing exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"duplicate, in which case the survivor’s identity. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" did not identify any entry and nothing moved.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/UsingIvorTiming"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/update(entryID:tempo:extras:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", this is expected to reorder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries — that is the point of editing the beat time itself. Two"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"entries legitimately ending up at the same beat time (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the discontinuity use case) is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not treated as a collision to reject; the moved entry simply takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its place among any others already there, exactly as a fresh","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insertion would.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The one case where ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" stops identifying the moved entry afterward is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the move lands it exactly on top of another entry already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present — same beat time, tempo, and extras — the same exact-duplicate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"case ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" silently collapses. There, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moved entry merges into that pre-existing one instead of being kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"separately, so "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" no longer names anything in the map; the returned"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"identity is the survivor’s instead, which a caller must switch to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"addressing from then on."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming","doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorTiming"}],"externalID":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV4move7entryID2toAC05EntryG0VSgAH_AA8BeatTimeVtF","extendedModule":"IvorTiming","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"move","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","text":"BeatTime","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"move(entryID:to:)"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/move(entryID:to:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Moves the tempo entry with the given identity to a new beat time,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeping its tempo and extras, and 